  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a wide frying pan over medium heat. Add the shallot and cook for 3–4 minutes, until softened.",
    "Stir in the garlic and chilli flakes and cook for 30 seconds, just until fragrant.",
    "Add the canned tomatoes, tomato paste, oregano, salt and black pepper. Simmer for 8–10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Add the prawns and cook for 2–3 minutes, turning once, until they are pink, opaque and just cooked through.",
    "Crumble the feta over the top and let it warm for 1 minute. Finish with parsley and serve hot."
